        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    principal = 5_000_000\n    annual_interest_rate = 0.058\n    loan_term_years = 10\n\n    # Calculate monthly interest rate and total number of payments\n    monthly_interest_rate = annual_interest_rate / 12\n    total_payments = loan_term_years * 12\n\n    # Calculate the fixed monthly mortgage repayment\n    monthly_payment = (\n        principal * monthly_interest_rate\n        / (1 - (1 + monthly_interest_rate) ** -total_payments)\n    )\n\n    # Return the initial repayment at the end of this month\n    return round(monthly_payment, 3)\n```",
